  "cited_article_id": "configure-automated-reminders",
  "reply": "First verify each patient’s profile has a verified mobile number and the opt‑in for SMS is enabled. Then open **Reports > Message Log** for the affected appointments; if the log shows a ‘Failed’ status, it may be due to carrier blocking or an unsupported phone number. Also confirm the appointment isn’t marked ‘Cancelled’ or ‘Arrived’, as reminders won’t send in those cases. If the numbers and statuses are correct and the log still shows failures, provide the patient IDs and timestamps to support for further investigation."
}
